# Private keys must never be committed.
# Only the committed production/placeholder public key (sukko.pub) + its fingerprint
# manifest (sukko.fingerprints) are embedded by default builds. The dev/e2e keypair
# (sukko.dev.key + sukko.dev.pub) and its manifest (sukko.dev.fingerprints) are
# regenerated by genkeys and MUST NOT be committed — the sukko_e2e build embeds
# sukko.dev.pub + sukko.dev.fingerprints.
*.key
sukko.dev.pub
sukko.dev.fingerprints
